# Test http requests for my api

### GET server root
GET http://localhost:3000/

### GET not found (404)
GET http://localhost:3000/something-not-found

### GET all items
GET http://localhost:3000/items

### GET item by id
GET http://localhost:3000/items/8

###D GET item that does not exist (404)
GET http://localhost:3000/items/999

### POST new item (201)
POST http://localhost:3000/items
content-type: application/json

{"name": "postattu itemi"}

### POST invalid JSON (400)
POST http://localhost:3000/items
content-type: application/json

{"name": rikki

### POST without name (400)
POST http://localhost:3000/items
content-type: application/json

{}

### PUT update item (200)
PUT http://localhost:3000/items/2
content-type: application/json

{"name": "muokattu itemi"}

### PUT item that does not exist (404)
PUT http://localhost:3000/items/999
content-type: application/json

{"name": "ei löydy"}

### DELETE item by id (204)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/items/6

### DELETE item that does not exist (404)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/items/999

### Method not allowed (405)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/items/1